------------------------------

SERVER CONFIGURATION

------------------------------

PORT=5000
NODE_ENV=development

------------------------------

GOOGLE AI STUDIO (GEMINI)

------------------------------

Get your API key from: https://aistudio.google.com/

Required for: Generative text for RFP creation, email parsing, and analysis.

GEMINI_API_KEY=

------------------------------

FIREBASE ADMIN SDK (BACKEND)

------------------------------

Required for: Backend access to Firestore and Auth (Privileged Access).

Option A: Inline JSON String (Best for PaaS like Render/Heroku)

Collapse your service-account.json into a single line string.

FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT=

Option B: File Path (Best for Local Development)

Path to your downloaded JSON key file relative to the server directory.

GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS=./firebase-service-account.json

------------------------------

CLIENT CONFIGURATION (OPTIONAL)

------------------------------

If you want to bundle client config in env (though usually this is public in client code)

FIREBASE_API_KEY=
FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=
FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=
